**Key Rules:**
- search text must EXACTLY match file content (character-for-character)
- ALWAYS read the file before editing to see exact content
- BEFORE confirming: verify unmarked context lines in after_edit connect properly with your edit (no orphaned braces/closures/structural issues)
- If structure looks correct → Edit.confirm. If problems visible → Edit.cancel, MODIFY your edit to correct for the issues, then retry

